  export function computeNextOccurrence(rule: RecurrenceRule, now?: Date): string;
  ```
  E especificar que `relativeTimeParser.ts` deve importar `RecurrenceRule` de `../storage/jsonStore.js`, e `reminderScheduler.ts` deve importar `computeNextOccurrence` de `./relativeTimeParser.js`.

